withdrawLink
  ├── when the caller does not have the LINK_OPERATOR_ROLE
  │   └── it should revert
  └── when the caller has the LINK_OPERATOR_ROLE
      ├── when the amount is zero
      │   └── it should revert
      └── when the amount is non-zero
          ├── it should transfer LINK to the caller
          └── it should emit a LinkWithdrawn event
